# Repos to clone, one per line:
#   <git url> <branch>
# Each lands in WORKSPACE_DIR/<owner>/<repo> (see config/versions.env), cloned with
# --recurse-submodules. The real list is config/repos.txt, git-ignored so every machine keeps
# its own. Easiest way to fill it: ./clone-repos.sh <github-owner> (search, select, clone).
# Or copy this file to config/repos.txt, edit it, and run ./install.sh --only clone-repos.
git@github.com:skoolscout/skoolscout-com.git develop
git@github.com:skoolscout/skoolscout-com-tenants.git develop
git@github.com:skoolscout/jefelabs-com.git develop
git@github.com:skoolscout/jefelabs-scripts.git develop
git@github.com:skoolscout/jefelabs-docs.git develop
